mai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/7599037f292b741d7c2a182921f628e9.webm?t=1748948207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/7599037f292b741d7c2a182921f628e9.mp4?t=1748948207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emote all over the story for some goofy time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/4ce38a29ee5acc5b2d956062f4240c58.poster.avif?t=1748948207\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/4ce38a29ee5acc5b2d956062f4240c58.webm?t=1748948207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/4ce38a29ee5acc5b2d956062f4240c58.mp4?t=1748948207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up and observe Nimbus and her illusions as they take down anything that stands in their way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/354e00c8760cfdc413c9b0ef3a5e4cf4.poster.avif?t=1748948207\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/354e00c8760cfdc413c9b0ef3a5e4cf4.webm?t=1748948207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/354e00c8760cfdc413c9b0ef3a5e4cf4.mp4?t=1748948207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why not settle who among you would have been the greatest eye magic warrior of all time... in a bit of &quot;<i>friendly</i>&quot; imagination battle?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/59b6785998b82d4f1ed617cf95425dc8.poster.avif?t=1748948207\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/59b6785998b82d4f1ed617cf95425dc8.webm?t=1748948207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/59b6785998b82d4f1ed617cf95425dc8.mp4?t=1748948207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MYSTERY OF ALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let us embark on this journey, and find out how everything ends...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Soul Waiter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/8636e8731f922b6a83e71b07f7521b3a.poster.avif?t=1748948207\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/8636e8731f922b6a83e71b07f7521b3a.webm?t=1748948207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/8636e8731f922b6a83e71b07f7521b3a.mp4?t=1748948207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PURCHASE &amp; DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By <u><strong>purchasing</strong></u>, you will gain access to <strong>Chapter 1</strong> and <strong>all other main chapter</strong> releases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By <u><strong>playing DEMO</strong></u>, you get <strong>limited access to</strong> <strong>Chapter 1</strong>, &quot;<strong>imaginations</strong>&quot; are not included, and any\u00a0<strong>achievements</strong> you observe will not count toward <strong>Steam achievements</strong>. However, when you switch to the full game, your story and choice progression will carry over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/7e11be4c152b0cd026b64826d3758e88.poster.avif?t=1748948207\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/7e11be4c152b0cd026b64826d3758e88.webm?t=1748948207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266500/extras/7e11be4c152b0cd026b64826d3758e88.mp4?t=1748948207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
